/datum/reagent/consumable/ethanol/lizardwine
	name = "Tailwine"
	description = "The severed tail of a Talunan ideologue was used to imbue ethanol with a seething disrespect for its owner and their empire. The resulting drink is highly illegal, but if you're making this, you're probably already KOS to the Empire for other reasons."

